ble - Manjaro Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu, 08 Jan 2026 12:46:08 +0000 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon Graphics (RADV REMBRANDT) - AMD Ryzen 5 PRO 6650U with Radeon Graphics (12 threads) - 14.39 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nEmpty dictionaries take 3 lines when serialized with JSON.stringify, when using a non-empty indent argument.\nFor instance, `print(JSON.stringify({\"a\": {}}, \"\\t\"))` produces:\n\n```json\n{\n\t\"a\": {\n\n\t}\n}\n```\n\nbut I think it would be cleaner with:\n\n```json\n{\n\t\"a\": {}\n}\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun `print(JSON.stringify({\"a\": {}}, \"\\t\"))`\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[stringify-dictionary-example.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25083418/stringify-dictionary-example.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115882/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github